-- ------------------------------------------------------------------ export offers (Smart Export Guarantee and supplier offers)
-- All are 'feed_in': exported kWh are paid the supplier's per-kWh rate (the engine holds it flat). Rates are the headline p/kWh from each
-- supplier's own page on 2026-11-22. low/high are left null: the engine adds the +/- missing_range_spread and labels the bounds as estimated.
-- Ofgem: any SEG rate must be above zero and is set by the supplier (https://www.ofgem.gov.uk/environmental-and-social-schemes/smart-export-guarantee-seg).
